      "id": "honeycutt-kaden",
      "wikidata": "Q111525616",
      "summary": {
        "text": "Kaden Wade Honeycutt (born June 23, 2003) is an American professional stock car racing driver. He competes full-time in the NASCAR Truck Series, driving the No. 11 Toyota Tundra TRD Pro for Tricon Garage. He has previously competed in the NASCAR Xfinity Series, the ARCA Menards Series, and the CARS Tour.\n\nHoneycutt is the 2026 NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series champion.",
        "lang": "en",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaden_Honeycutt"
      },
      "birthDate": "2003-06-23",
      "nationality": "Estados Unidos",
